WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.330
Hello!

2
00:00:05.331 --> 00:00:08.384
Who

3
00:00:08.385 --> 00:00:11.170
are you? I'm

4
00:00:11.171 --> 00:00:14.462
a wild turkey. Turkeys

5
00:00:14.463 --> 00:00:18.829
are large birds. Where

6
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.839
do you live? We

7
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.802
live all over the world. We

8
00:00:25.803 --> 00:00:28.504
like forests. But

9
00:00:28.505 --> 00:00:34.295
we also live in swamps and grasslands. What

10
00:00:34.296 --> 00:00:37.026
do you eat? Wild

11
00:00:37.027 --> 00:00:42.355
turkeys like nuts, seeds, and fruits. We

12
00:00:42.356 --> 00:00:46.923
also eat bugs and tiny animals. We

13
00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:52.114
scratch the ground to find food. You're

14
00:00:52.115 --> 00:00:55.476
a male turkey, right? Right!

15
00:00:55.477 --> 00:01:00.033
Males are bigger than females. Our

16
00:01:00.034 --> 00:01:04.096
heads are very colorful. And

17
00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:08.900
our tails look like fans.

18
00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:12.402
Can you make sounds?

19
00:01:12.403 --> 00:01:22.247
Yes! Male turkeys make a loud gobble sound.

20
00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:27.068
We are very loud sometimes!

21
00:01:27.069 --> 00:01:30.456
Do you ever fly?

22
00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:35.565
Wild turkeys like to walk and run.

23
00:01:35.566 --> 00:01:39.554
But we can fly too.

24
00:01:39.555 --> 00:01:46.489
At night we fly up into trees.

25
00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:49.937
I see your flock!

26
00:01:49.938 --> 00:01:53.337
We like to stay in groups.

27
00:01:53.338 --> 00:01:57.409
That keeps us safe from enemies.

28
00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:03.259
Coyotes, foxes, and people hunt us.

29
00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:07.662
I need some sleep.

30
00:02:07.663 --> 00:02:11.114
Gobble! Gobble!

31
00:02:11.115 --> 00:02:17.377
Good night, Wild Turkey!

